  "reasoning": [
    "The authenticated original observation transport has one immutable observationRecordSha256 per original observation. Its enclosing case additionally carries UID, viewport and screenshot transport metadata, so hashing that case is a different contract.",
    "The original failing code compared both binding.observationRecordSha256 and reuse.originalObservationRecordSha256 with the enclosing-case hash. The fixed code compares both with the authenticated embedded digest and adds exact seven-key, key, ordinal and SHA-256 shape checks.",
    "buildBase still authenticates the complete originalObserved document through fixedDocument, which checks immutable commit/path bytes and current live bytes. The change does not allow replacement observation digests or a new visual decision.",
    "All source/issued-row/runtime-inventory/caller identity/private-token/Native callbacks, original48/51/Q10/E023 solution authority checks and current six direct visual results remain byte-identical outside the two exact helper edits."
  ],
